# ECart 🛒

A full-stack e-commerce web application built with the MERN stack (MongoDB, Express, React, Node.js), featuring a customer storefront, admin panel, and integrated payment gateways.

## 🔗 Live Demo
- **Storefront:** https://e-cart-nu-cyan.vercel.app
- **Admin Panel:** https://e-cart-6g4k.vercel.app

## ✨ Features
- Browse products, add to cart, checkout
- User authentication (JWT)
- Admin panel to add/manage products
- Image uploads via Cloudinary
- Payment integration with Razorpay and Stripe
- Responsive design

## 🛠 Tech Stack
- **Frontend:** React (Vite), Tailwind CSS
- **Backend:** Node.js, Express
- **Database:** MongoDB (Atlas)
- **Auth:** JWT, bcrypt
- **Payments:** Razorpay, Stripe
- **Image hosting:** Cloudinary
- **Deployment:** Vercel (frontend/admin), Render (backend)

