## 🚀 Getting Started Locally

### Backend
```bash
cd backend
npm install
npm start
```

### Frontend
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

### Admin
```bash
cd admin
npm install
npm run dev
```

Each folder needs its own `.env` file with the required environment variables (Mongo URI, JWT secret, Cloudinary keys, payment gateway keys, etc.).

